Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 22:04:40 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 20/63] cpu_type.h: split per arch and add arm64 identification

Previously it supported only x86(-64) using #ifdef.
Adding a #ifdef branch for each architecture would become unwieldy
soon, so I split it up into three files..

Added some vendor strings which were missing previously as well
(Sun, Fujitsu), and ones needed for ARM vendors.

